##🏢 Industry Insight: PPG Digital Infrastructure
Date: 20 November 2025

Focus: Enterprise Systems & Data Visualization

I attended a virtual briefing with PPG Industries to explore how large-scale digital architecture supports global operations. While my background is in Graphics & Multimedia, this session provided deep insights into the "bridge" between backend complexity and frontend usability.

🗝️ Key Learnings:
ERP & Data Integrity: Exploring how SAP maintains consistency across global systems.

Operational Efficiency: Understanding digital tracking from supplier procurement to final payment.

Industrial UI/UX: The challenge of transforming high-speed, complex data into accessible visual dashboards.

Takeaway: Great software requires both a high-performance engine and an intuitive dashboard. I am applying these systematic design thinking principles to ensure my UI/UX projects can handle complex, real-world data.

